{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊8/6 かなりん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日おめでとう｡+ﾟ((ヾ(o･ω･)ﾉ ))｡+"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乙かなりそー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルヲタクなアイドル、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもアイドルについて色々と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"教えてくれてありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ええ、そうです。わたしが色んな人に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅってヲタクだよね⁇ って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聞かれるのは、花奈のせいです。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰り道が途中まで一緒で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと前から一緒に帰ってて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも面白い話をしてくれる花奈！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はね、花奈としゃべるの結構"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張する(´・ω・｀)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てか、人としゃべるの緊張するから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初の方は花奈にも心開いてなかった笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今じゃあ花奈すきすきよ～(照)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しゃべりやすいの～(照)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上から読んでも下から読んでも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田花奈！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上から読んでも下から読んでも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さいとうあすかすあうといさ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じ感じだし、これからも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に頑張ろうね＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また一緒に帰って～(*/ω＼*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コンビニ寄ろうっっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当おめでとう‼‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと更新あいちゃったので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心配してくれた方ありがとう＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんね(> <)大丈夫だよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりゃあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/07/6640199/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたんにぶちゅううう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってされたから、仕返し(*´艸`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅはね、メンバー誰でも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほっぺとかだけ可！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"唇戦隊 唇ンジャー(だっけ⁇笑)は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"唇をお守りしてます＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファーストちゅーは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出来るならずっと とっておくのにゃ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーの誰かさんに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"奪われそうだけどね～(*/ω＼*)照笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊----------------------------------------＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1945年 8月6日 午前8時15分"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島県に、原爆が投下された日。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしは広島県出身じゃないし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１回も行ったことないし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この原爆についても、まだあんまり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校では詳しく勉強してないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど、自分なりに調べて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とってもとっても大切な日だって事は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"起きてからテレビをつけてみても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この原爆についての番組は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんまりやってませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしてだろう⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じ日本なのに、ちょっとだけ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寂しくなりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心の傷は、消えないかもしれない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでも、少しだけでも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その傷を癒せるようになりたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"平和。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はね、撮影と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッスンしてきました！*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"叫びながら踊って楽しかった。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと勉強しよ！自分磨きー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりゃあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/07/6640199/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メガネあしゅ久々じゃない⁇笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか恥ずかしいな～(*/ω＼*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似合わないとか 言わないの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は、ある方とお出かけしてから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッスン！リハ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また書きます(´･-･`)ゼァ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやしゅりんちゃっっ"}],"source":"archive"}